+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+## Voyage: TodoMVC build
+
+**Source spec:** `assets/app-spec.md`
+**Base template:** `assets/app-template.index.html`
+
+### Decisions
+
+- localStorage key: `todos-vanillajs` (spec says `todos-[framework]`; vanilla JS = vanillajs).
+- Routing: hash-based (`#/`, `#/active`, `#/completed`). No external router library — vanilla JS `hashchange` listener is sufficient for three routes.
+- Directory layout per spec: `js/app.js` as single file; `css/app.css` for overrides. No controllers/models split needed for vanilla JS.
+- happy-dom for DOM-level Cucumber scenarios (RIGGING already declares it).
+
+### Watchbill
+
+3 watches, 35 scenarios total. Ordered by implementation dependency: core (24), routing (6), persistence (5).
+
+### Next
+
+QM is next. Dispatch with base commit `2105b20` and the watchbill above.
diff --git a/features/todomvc-persistence.feature b/features/todomvc-persistence.feature
new file mode 100644
