--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todomvc-persistence.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@
+Feature: TodoMVC persistence
+  As a user returning to the app
+  I want my todos saved to localStorage
+  So that my data survives page reloads
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+
+  Scenario: Todos persist across page reload
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When I type "Buy milk" in the new todo input and press Enter
+    And the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo list has 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Completed state persists across reload
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I toggle the todo at position 1
+    And the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is completed
+
+  Scenario: Edited title persists across reload
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I double-click the label of todo at position 1
+    And I clear the edit input and type "Buy oat milk" and press Enter
+    And the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy oat milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Deleted todos stay deleted after reload
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | false     |
+    When I hover over the todo at position 1
+    And I click the destroy button of todo at position 1
+    And the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo list has 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Walk dog" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: localStorage uses key "todos-vanillajs"
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When I type "Buy milk" in the new todo input and press Enter
+    Then the localStorage has a key "todos-vanillajs" with JSON containing a todo with title "Buy milk"
diff --git a/features/todomvc-routing.feature b/features/todomvc-routing.feature
