+++ b/features/todomvc-routing.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,59 @@
+Feature: TodoMVC routing
+  As a user navigating filtered views
+  I want hash-based routing to filter todos
+  So that I can see all, active, or completed todos
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+
+  Scenario: Default route shows all todos
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    When the page loads
+    Then the "All" filter is selected
+    And the todo list has 2 items
+
+  Scenario: Active route filters to incomplete todos
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then the "Active" filter is selected
+    And the todo list has 1 item
+
+  Scenario: Completed route filters to done todos
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    When I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then the "Completed" filter is selected
+    And the todo list has 1 item
+
+  Scenario: Checking an active todo hides it under Active filter
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    And I navigate to "#/active"
+    When I toggle the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo list has 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Unchecking a completed todo hides it under Completed filter
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    And I navigate to "#/completed"
+    When I toggle the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo list has 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Filter persists across page reloads
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    And the page is reloaded
+    Then the "Active" filter is selected
+    And the todo list has 1 item
diff --git a/features/todomvc.feature b/features/todomvc.feature
