+++ b/features/todomvc.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,193 @@
+Feature: TodoMVC core functionality
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want a TodoMVC app with add, edit, toggle, and clear actions
+  So that I can track my to-do items
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+
+  # --- No todos state ---
+
+  Scenario: No todos hides main and footer
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer section is hidden
+
+  # --- New todo ---
+
+  Scenario: New todo is created on Enter
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When I type "Buy milk" in the new todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list has 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+    And the new todo input is empty
+
+  Scenario: Empty input does not create a todo
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When I type "   " in the new todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list has 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Input is trimmed before creating todo
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When I type "  Buy milk  " in the new todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: New todo input is focused on page load
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    Then the new todo input is focused
+
+  # --- Mark all as complete ---
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all marks all todos as complete
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | false     |
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos are completed
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all clears when all items are individually checked
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | false     |
+    When I toggle the todo at position 1
+    And I toggle the todo at position 2
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all unchecks when one item is unchecked
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | true      |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    When I toggle the todo at position 1
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  # --- Item interactions ---
+
+  Scenario: Clicking checkbox toggles todo completion
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I toggle the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is completed
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking label activates edit mode
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I double-click the label of todo at position 1
+    Then the todo at position 1 is in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Hovering over todo shows destroy button
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I hover over the todo at position 1
+    Then the destroy button of todo at position 1 is visible
+
+  # --- Editing ---
+
+  Scenario: Edit is saved on Enter
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I double-click the label of todo at position 1
+    And I clear the edit input and type "Buy oat milk" and press Enter
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy oat milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Edit is saved on blur
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I double-click the label of todo at position 1
+    And I clear the edit input and type "Buy oat milk" and blur
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy oat milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Empty edit destroys the todo
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I double-click the label of todo at position 1
+    And I clear the edit input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list has 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Esc cancels edit without saving
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    When I double-click the label of todo at position 1
+    And I clear the edit input and type "Changed" and press Escape
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  # --- Counter ---
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows number of active items
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | false     |
+      | Clean house | true      |
+    Then the counter shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows singular for one item
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    Then the counter shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows zero items
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    Then the counter shows "0 items left"
+
+  # --- Clear completed ---
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    When I click the clear completed button
+    Then the todo list has 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button hidden when no completed items
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+    Then the clear completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button visible when completed items exist
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | true      |
+    Then the clear completed button is visible
+
+  # --- Visibility toggling ---
+
+  Scenario: Completed todo is hidden when filter is Active
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then the todo list has 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Active todo is hidden when filter is Completed
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    When I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then the todo list has 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Walk dog" and is completed
+
+  Scenario: All todos shown when filter is All
+    Given the todo list has these items:
+      | title       | completed |
+      | Buy milk    | false     |
+      | Walk dog    | true      |
+    When I navigate to "#/"
+    Then the todo list has 2 items
